application "Desktop Notes" is desktop

model Note
field title is text required
field details is text
field important is boolean default false
that is all

controller Notes
action "initialize desktop"
set status to "Ready for a note"
set live_preview to "Start typing a note"
set window_status to "Window opened"
collect every Note title as note_titles
that is all

action "save note"
create a Note using the current values as note_id
count all Note records as note_count
collect every Note title as note_titles
set status to "Saved note:" joined with note_id
open view "notes"
that is all

when application starts
run action "initialize desktop"
show view "notes"
that is all

when input title changes
set live_preview to "Typing:" joined with title
that is all

when input title is submitted
run action "save note"
that is all

when input details changes
set status to "Editing details"
that is all

when input important changes
set status to "Importance changed"
that is all

when window gains focus
set window_status to "Window focused"
that is all

when window loses focus
set window_status to "Window unfocused"
that is all
that is all

view "notes"
show the following in a card
heading "Native desktop notes"
text "This window and its controls are rendered by GTK, not a browser."
arrange the following in a column
input "Note title" as title
show live_preview
textarea "Note details" as details
checkbox "Important" as important
that is all
arrange the following in a row
button "Save note" runs action "save note"
text "Application status:"
show status
that is all
show window_status
show the following in a table
use "Saved note titles" as a table heading
for each note_title in note_titles show
show the following in a table row
show note_title in a table cell
that is all
that is all
that is all
that is all
that is all
